long walls: for sz of [-1,1]: addWallRun(-halfW, sz*26, 52, PI/2, sz>0?trimBlue:trimRed) and same +halfW.
end segments: accent based on sz.
Then remove strip loop.

Also addWallRun's panelRepeat unused, remove param.

